SUMMARY:Astral Heaven is Here! How to Live from the Real World of Love
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nYou’re ready for
  a real life and you know it! Life is designed to be joyful because love i
 s what makes any reality real. Collective culture has been teaching unreal
  unnecessary struggle and suffering for thousands of years. When you’re 
 ready you can truly just leave. How? That’s the trick to learn\, since f
 alse negative belief systems will mislead you in both directions. On one h
 and you’re told to fight and work hard to earn your way to happiness\, w
 hich results in anxious exhaustion and the shame of always failing. You fa
 il because real life is already easy\, so you can’t fix what isn’t bro
 ken. On the other hand you’re told to fantasize and wait for rescue\, wh
 ich results in addictions and panic from accepting powerlessness. Buddha
 ’s middle way is the unlimited path for the kingdom of heaven that Jesus
  taught. Join us this Sunday May 22\, 2026 for the truth of your spiritual
  home and how to live from the heaven on Earth.\n\nYou need to unlearn a l
 ot of the rules you were raised with. You need a huge paradigm shift to be
 come safe\, happy and healthy again. So much change can be scary\, but the
  alternative is worse to die on an ecologically collapsing war-torn planet
 . So a lot of people are feeling confused and caught between a rock and a 
 hard place. Don’t worry though\, because working for you is the fact tha
 t your human being is built for heaven. That’s right\, you come from a p
 aradise that nature gives you for free. Life is abundant and generous\, as
  your emotions and love will guide you smoothly to freedom. Negative human
  society is manipulative and deceiving. You were sold many lies to keep yo
 u stressed and choosing badly. The suffering is real even when the lifesty
 le is artificial.\n\nWe’re at the end of the old world\, and we need a m
 iracle. Fortunately\, miraculous new solutions are how the Universe works 
 naturally. It’s not escapist to expect life to be magical\, it’s escap
 ist and ill-advised to not expect magic. Miracles are outcomes better than
  you expected given your old limited belief systems. Beliefs give your ass
 umptions\, expectations\, explanations\, rules and definitions for how you
  think life works. This starts subjective and ends up objective. If you do
 n’t think a solution can possibly work\, then you won’t try it and it 
 will fade away. Entire realities can phase in and out of visible existence
 . Before the 1900’s such talk was fairy tales. But quantum physics has s
 hown there are no physical objects. We interact with eternal infinite ener
 gy fields in ways that make objects appear.\n\nEinstein’s special relati
 vity proved time and space are just stories we invent out of a single eter
 nal resource called spacetime. Physical reality only feels solid because t
 he electrostatic forces prevent interpenetration of things that are mostly
  empty space. This is pure magic if you know how to use it. Reality is a p
 rogrammable consciousness experience that you were trained to run unconsci
 ously. Don’t like the result? Revisit old choices to change them conscio
 usly to new positive belief systems. Learn how the living loving Universe 
 really works to live happily ever after. Or die miserably. Your choice.\n\
 nPersonally I think it’s a no-brainer to choose between happy or dying. 
 The first one\, thank you God\, Goddess\, Great Spirit\, Source! But I kno
 w better than to try and force my opinion on other people. You can’t cha
 nge another consciousness\, because everyone always has their own experien
 ce. You can argue facts but you can’t argue personal experience. Folks w
 ill think\, say\, do\, and feel whatever they want\, even if they must bel
 ieve crazy mean shit to stay miserable. Out of ignorance and trauma\, a lo
 t of people are sadly choosing to fight and die to the bitter end. Fortuna
 tely\, you don’t have to join them. It is enough to change your own mind
  to create your own reality from the love of your own astral heaven.\n\nFo
 r this meetup\, look at your ideas of a perfect life\, and notice what kin
 ds of judgments come up to fight it. Are you told that you’re selfish\, 
 unrealistic\, lazy\, or crazy? Would you rather believe in your dreams or 
 cling to a failed false society? We’ll study how reality really works to
  keep your destiny happy waiting for you to choose it. You never actually 
 have to make a better world\, only tune into where you belong in a pre-exi
 sting multiverse. Your beliefs filter the objective paradise Source into s
 ubjective experiences of heaven or hell. It’s time to be in the world an
 d not of it. You’ll learn how to design your own best belief system with
  your higher self’s guidance to live happily ever after.\n\nWelcome! Our
  Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 
 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you 
 can’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup here for this meeti
 ng and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and 
 more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiri
 tual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.
 signupISM.com)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-triangle-activities/events/31
 4920027/
