SUMMARY:Puppy Yoga - Waitlist only
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nWe will be at Fort
 night Brewing in Cary for a morning yoga session with Jazzy's puppies\, pl
 us other PIPs Pups!\n\nThe class is $25\, and proceeds all come back to PI
 Ps to help with their medical expenses!\nhttps://pipsrescue.org\n\nSign up
  here:\nhttps://givebutter.com/puppy-yoga-love?fbclid=IwY2xjawRce4ZleHRuA2
 FlbQIxMABicmlkETFuNXdJMEpPUUVlaFRvQUtBc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5
 MgABHkcmjNaasKFCWZh8AEKxeufZnEL4yjNv2dQ29-RAq35EJKGAa1Iuy5vZwOh5_aem_4sd_6
 oiYMGNPNEj_EnGGLw\n\nIf this is sold out and you want to be on the waitlis
 t\, please email [Nicole.k@pipsrescue.org](mailto:Nicole.k@pipsrescue.org)
 \n\nHuge Thank you to Stacey Paige for donating her time to this yoga clas
 s: [https://www.staceypaige.com/](https://www.staceypaige.com/)\n\nStick a
 round after yoga for an adoption event!
